   "pending": "Charge state = two exclusive marks on Ando: 'Charged' then 'Supercharged' (each duration 1, so the augment window lasts 1 turn per DURATION_ANCHOR). The passive is the 'Stored Charge' skillUsed trigger: after Ando finishes any skill it advances his state one step (none->Charged->Supercharged) and grants Elemental Essence on each real step (no step / no essence once already Supercharged). Each active skill reads its CURRENT Charged/Supercharged mark for its augmented branch (skillUsed fires AFTER effects resolve, verified scheduler.ts:413,427). Two per-use opt-out marks encode skills that manage their own charge: 'chargeHandled' (Expel/Focus/Overclock -> passive skips auto-advance) and 'noOverclockConvert' (Focus/Overclock -> Overclock's convert trigger skips them). ENGINE_GAPS.md calls this exact self-augmentation pattern a 'false gap' — plain if/forEach reading own state."
